description:
The purpose of this notice is to draw attention to a procurement the Authority will conduct to establish a National Framework Agreement for the provision of Respiratory Solutions 2026 under the following Lot structure:
Lot 1: Respiratory Therapy;
Lot 2: Anaesthesia and Resuscitation;
Lot 3: Diagnostics;
Lot 4: Nitrous Oxide destruction Solutions; and
Lot 5: Respiratory Support Services
For Lots 1 to 4 Tenderers can submit for one, more than one Lot, or all of the Lots detailed above. However ONL

